{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在音乐细节的颗粒度、情绪转折的细微层次，以及感受与具体乐句的同步呈现上明显不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分区让观众可以一边听音乐一边快速读取完整叙事，左侧句子把人物的念头、顾虑和行为因果交代得比较清楚，前后也更容易连成一条心理变化的线。Y的重点高亮和分段呈现有利于抓取每段核心，但感受词过密，部分意象跳跃或重复，容易让观众在听音乐时忙于处理文字；不过Y对情绪细部、声音变化和瞬间感受的捕捉确实更丰富、更精细。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "340ca8fe-ada9-4b8e-a7e0-955816f547da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022800693317Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:28:31.532431+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0696fd81699caae085994849dcd6fecc5514740338b19db3e4031be32cf28f35", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388